    "detailed_description": "Help Saga in her quest for revenge. A Viking girl who has lost everything to evil will embark on an epic journey to find answers and end the hordes of enemies ravaging her land.<br><br>With great graphics, soundtrack and FX, Saga is a 2D platformer that will take you back to your gaming days on the Mega Drive or Master System in the 90s.<br><br><strong>Game features:</strong><br><br>A small story that will hook you from the beginning.<br>10 levels with a map where you can select the path you choose.<br>10 tunes from the 80's, one per level.<br>11 Final Bosses completely different and worthy adversaries of Saga.<br>Lots of different enemies to face.<br>Lots of combat!<br><br><strong>Technical details:</strong><br><br>16:9 screen to remember the old days.<br>16 color palette.<br>Pixel perfect scaling.<br>CRT filter.",
